    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/946300/extras/993e5a4baeffc6f71fc7b996cce0d751.avif?t=1727355048\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/946300/extras/4ff287703e38c9e5a9c9cd73b1677967.avif?t=1727355048\" /></div>The problem game of Kohei Gallery has been powered up and came back!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Appears much easier to play than previous work!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/946300/extras/08143ac49bca1858804ce626b9734169.avif?t=1727355048\" /></div>You can play intuitively with the mouse!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Left click: Shooting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Right click: Reload</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/946300/extras/1a89806233b752344982740efd5bcc71.avif?t=1727355048\" /></div>MISSION which is difficult for the game is prepared!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Let's challenge with the skill of mouse operation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/946300/extras/5d6e482b1cb8c7443016710f2d989196.avif?t=1727355048\" /></div>If you meet the stage's success criteria, you can challenge the next stage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\